      "officialTitle": "A Phase 1 Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, 2-Part Study to Assess the Safety and Tolerability, Pharmacokinetics, And Pharmacodynamics of Single and Multiple Doses of REGN4461 in Healthy Subjects",
