      },
      "overallDuration": "Part A up to 16 weeks; Part B up to 27 weeks",
      "safetySummary": "Mibavademab was generally well tolerated; most adverse events were mild or moderate, and no treatment-emergent anti-drug antibodies were observed in participants receiving repeated mibavademab doses.",
